{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","hash":"0f0f7755c0a4c93162d4dc30cef56923f3448c94b11a4dc2602df97ada875aaf","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017vygntng66PyEuYHxvKdJN","type":"tool_result","content":"[1]-  Exit 1                  SCENE_PLY=\"$R/Equipment Room.ply\" SCENE_ASSETS=\"$T/assets_mapped.json\" SCENE_GRID=\"$T/nav_grid.npz\" nohup uv run --no-project --with numpy --with scipy --with fastapi --with uvicorn --with pydantic --with openpyxl --with pandas --with pillow --with 'psycopg[binary]' uvicorn app.api.main:app --port 8001 > \"$S/bim_check/api.log\" 2>&1\nBIM button hidden: False elements: 445\nstatus: BIM model: 445 elements, simulated from the scan\nTraceback (most recent call last):\nplaywright._impl._errors.TimeoutError: Page.wait_for_function: Timeout 30000ms exceeded.\nShell cwd was reset to /home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","is_error":false},{"type":"text","text":"The user sent a new message while you were working:\nRegarding moving an object (black chair) when we move it the path updates to take the moved chair into account but once we or the person moves the new location of the chair gets ignored and the shortest path/route goes through it (you can use an agent to work on this while you check BIM stuff)\n\nThis is how Claude Code surfaces messages the user sends mid-turn — within the running turn, often alongside the next tool result, rather than as a separate conversation turn. Address the message above as you continue this turn."}]}}
