{"parentUuid":"654bea70-1a64-4f61-843d-b76c97c62f12","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"06369c86-4382-4e7b-a07e-00f01f8f9bda","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Aq5vBBw7xLQcrBUgzwAPEi","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# viktortrilar: viktor/move-any-object\n2\t**Goal:** let operators correct objects: move safely, split, combine, and see frames clearly, working with the team's highlights and live routes\n3\t**Done:** collision check, Split, Combine, frames that hide what's behind them. Fixed clashes with live routes and highlights: routes only follow the camera in walk mode, a refused drop re-plans, collision warnings aren't overwritten\n4\t**Verified:** lint; 213 tests passed, 2 skipped. Full flow in a headless browser with pieces, highlights and live routes: refused drop, demo move 4.31 to 5.56 m, split, combine, reload, undo, no page errors. Slow software rendering, light scene. Not tested: 5090, tablet, real model in the browser panel\n5\t**Next:** rehearse on the 5090. Build the precision sample from crops rendered on the 5090, as Roihu's masks are out of reach. A person confirms P-005 on obj-0049\n6\t**Blockers:** Roihu closed until at least Monday (CSC security notice). Objects cut on demand take neighbours in their box along, and leave marks. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge: don't merge it\n7\t"}]},"uuid":"08072d8d-8ab5-4ab6-a0bd-2f90193d69de","timestamp":"2026-11-07T12:28:09.137Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/handoffs/viktortrilar.md","content":"# viktortrilar: viktor/move-any-object\n**Goal:** let operators correct objects: move safely, split, combine, and see frames clearly, working with the team's highlights and live routes\n**Done:** collision check, Split, Combine, frames that hide what's behind them. Fixed clashes with live routes and highlights: routes only follow the camera in walk mode, a refused drop re-plans, collision warnings aren't overwritten\n**Verified:** lint; 213 tests passed, 2 skipped. Full flow in a headless browser with pieces, highlights and live routes: refused drop, demo move 4.31 to 5.56 m, split, combine, reload, undo, no page errors. Slow software rendering, light scene. Not tested: 5090, tablet, real model in the browser panel\n**Next:** rehearse on the 5090. Build the precision sample from crops rendered on the 5090, as Roihu's masks are out of reach. A person confirms P-005 on obj-0049\n**Blockers:** Roihu closed until at least Monday (CSC security notice). Objects cut on demand take neighbours in their box along, and leave marks. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge: don't merge it\n","numLines":7,"startLine":1,"totalLines":7}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"654bea70-1a64-4f61-843d-b76c97c62f12","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/route-keeps-moved-objects","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
