{"parentUuid":"3862d5bf-c212-407d-a218-e309beab1db0","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/handoffs/viktortrilar.md","snippet":"1\t# viktortrilar: viktor/move-any-object\n2\t**Goal:** let operators correct objects: move safely, split, combine, and see frames clearly, working with the team's highlights and live routes\n3\t**Done:** collision check, Split, Combine, frames that hide what's behind them. Fixed clashes with live routes and highlights: routes only follow the camera in walk mode, a refused drop re-plans, collision warnings aren't overwritten\n4\t**Verified:** lint; 213 tests passed, 2 skipped. Full flow in a headless browser with pieces, highlights and live routes: refused drop, demo move 4.31 to 5.56 m, split, combine, reload, undo, no page errors. Slow software rendering, light scene. Not tested: 5090, tablet, real model in the browser panel\n5\t**Next:** rehearse on the 5090. Build the precision sample from crops rendered on the 5090, as Roihu's masks are out of reach. A person confirms P-005 on obj-0049\n6\t**Blockers:** Roihu closed until at least Monday (CSC security notice). Objects cut on demand take neighbours in their box along, and leave marks. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge: don't merge it","rereadEntry":{"timestamp":1794054832437,"contentHash":"165k5iurba3by","contentLength":1105}},"type":"attachment","uuid":"55795afe-c745-4db1-b4a5-c479602dd9d9","timestamp":"2026-11-07T12:33:52.756Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNote: /home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/handoffs/viktortrilar.md changed on disk since you last read it. That's usually deliberate, so take it as the current state rather than reverting it; if the change looks wrong, say so rather than undoing it yourself — otherwise no need to call it out. Here are the relevant changes (shown with line numbers):\n1\t# viktortrilar: viktor/move-any-object\n2\t**Goal:** let operators correct objects: move safely, split, combine, and see frames clearly, working with the team's highlights and live routes\n3\t**Done:** collision check, Split, Combine, frames that hide what's behind them. Fixed clashes with live routes and highlights: routes only follow the camera in walk mode, a refused drop re-plans, collision warnings aren't overwritten\n4\t**Verified:** lint; 213 tests passed, 2 skipped. Full flow in a headless browser with pieces, highlights and live routes: refused drop, demo move 4.31 to 5.56 m, split, combine, reload, undo, no page errors. Slow software rendering, light scene. Not tested: 5090, tablet, real model in the browser panel\n5\t**Next:** rehearse on the 5090. Build the precision sample from crops rendered on the 5090, as Roihu's masks are out of reach. A person confirms P-005 on obj-0049\n6\t**Blockers:** Roihu closed until at least Monday (CSC security notice). Objects cut on demand take neighbours in their box along, and leave marks. Local branch viktor/viewer-objects holds an unused merge: don't merge it\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/bim-model-fixes","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
