for a move, real DXF and IFC downloads, all buttons on screen at 1024 and 800 px wide, no page errors.\n- Read back after dragging the cart to (-1.46, -1.75): the DXF changed by exactly the cart's 4 lines, and the IFC has 0 schema issues with the cart at that spot.\n\n**Not tested:** opening the files in a real CAD or BIM tool, the 5090, a tablet. Rotation from Eduard's branch isn't handled: once it merges, footprints, BIM boxes and exports will follow an object's position but not its turn.\n\n**Conflicts to expect:** `web/main.js`, `web/index.html` and `web/style.css` overlap with the unmerged tablet work on `eduard` and `benjamin/webviewer`.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\ngh pr create --base viktor/bim-model-fixes --head viktor/bim --title \"Add a Plan screen, a DXF export, and an IFC download with operator changes\" --body-file \"$S/pr2.md\" 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-100; gh pr list --state open --json number,headRefName,baseRefName --jq '.[] | \"#\\(.number) \\(.headRefName) -> \\(.baseRefName)\"'; echo \"--- trial: both PRs on today's main, against the teammates' branches\"; for b in origin/eduard origin/benjamin/webviewer; do echo \"[$b + viktor/bim]\"; git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only \"$b\" viktor/bim 2>&1 | sed -n '2,/^$/p' | grep -v '^$' | head -12 | cut -c1-60 | tr '\\n' ' '; echo; done; git worktree list | cut -c1-110; git status -sb | head -2 | cut -c1-70","description":"Push my branch, open the stacked pull request, and check conflicts","timeout":120000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"726db69b-c0f4-4682-bf17-0102d0071d79","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgochSU97UwmwZBPNbqYY","requestRef":"56b18159-d7bb-48fc-a18f-d2f71068efd5","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"93fc78db-e8f5-4d9d-88d8-aea858b70bc9","timestamp":"2026-11-07T13:05:38.887Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-v