{"parentUuid":"3a2198aa-b122-48a0-9bf1-edc6fc18a7ed","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgocnABFY1q5KVKi5DKTX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":946,"cache_read_input_tokens":337681,"output_tokens":2742,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1577},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":946,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2742,"cache_read_input_tokens":337681,"cache_creation_input_tokens":946,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":946},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":21200,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"db678398-c04d-4ae1-ae61-0abc21af1895","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cgocn9ixeAsrmjrPYvDhT","requestRef":"2dc15963-2b54-4863-ab6a-cfdc1fd31e5b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"f337c753-5187-4ba0-b321-49e10de8a520","timestamp":"2026-11-07T13:06:45.912Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/bim","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
{"parentUuid":"f337c753-5187-4ba0-b321-49e10de8a520","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgocnABFY1q5KVKi5DKTX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Everything is built and passing, but nothing is merged.** The permission system blocked my merge of #26, even with your \"do all steps\", and I didn't try to get around it. Please merge it on GitHub, or tell me \"merge #26\" and I'll retry. After that, #27 needs its base changed to `main` (I can do that) and your word to merge.\n\n## What's in the PRs\n**[#26: Sasha's BIM mode plus fixes](https://github.com/Sairanyx/Newbies/pull/26).** Sasha's commit is unchanged and Sasha's own branch wasn't touched.\n- **Oversized tank:** `obj-0144` is now a plain box; the other 64 fits are unchanged apart from a new flag.\n- **Objects made in the viewer:** split, combined and added objects now show as plain boxes instead of vanishing.\n- **Usage guide:** the wrong note about `make bim` picking up operator changes is corrected.\n\n**[#27: my work, stacked on #26](https://github.com/Sairanyx/Newbies/pull/27)**\n- **Plan screen:** shows the room from above with the route, your position, tag search and tap-to-open panels.\n- **Plan fixes:** the panel opens on top, names no longer pile up, and searching a type highlights all of them.\n- **Downloads:** there's a new DXF, and **Download IFC** now includes operator changes while the backend is running. Without the backend you get the file `make bim` built.\n- **One room size:** Plan uses Sasha's wall estimate, so it's 9.12 × 7.27 m everywhere. My own wall fit and IFC export are gone.\n\n## Changes you might notice\n- **`P-005?` everywhere:** P-005 now reads `P-005?` in labels and panels across the whole viewer, because its link is unconfirmed. This will show in the demo, though the **Go to P-005** button keeps its name. It's a small change to undo if you'd rather not show it.\n- **Button row bug on main:** on tablet-width screens, **Go to P-005** and **Copilot** slid off the left edge once a route was showing. The row now wraps, so all buttons stay on screen.\n- **Empty DXF:** this came from my test browser, not the app, and real downloads work. The viewer's proxy really was dropping file types and names, and that's fixed.\n\n## Testing\n- **Automated:** 231 tests pass, 2 skipped, and lint is clean. CI passes on both PRs, but it skips anything needing numpy, so I ran the full set locally.\n- **Browser, real scene:** Plan, search, tap, moving the cart and real downloads all work, with no page errors.\n- **Exports after moving the cart:** the DXF changed by exactly the cart's 4 lines. The IFC has 0 schema issues and shows the cart at its new spot.\n- **Not tested:** opening the files in a real CAD or BIM tool, the 5090, or a tablet.\n\n## After merging\n- **Teammates:** run `git pull` and `make bim`, then restart the viewer.\n- **Conflicts:** Eduard's branch will conflict in `Makefile`, `app/api/main.py` and `web/main.js`. Benjamin's conflicts in those plus `web/highlight.js`, `web/index.html` and `web/style.css`.\n- **Rotation:** once Eduard's object rotation merges, Plan, BIM boxes and the exports will follow an object's position but not its turn.\n\nThe chair bug agent is still running, and I'll report back when it finishes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":946,"cache_read_input_tokens":337681,"output_tokens":2742,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1577},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":946,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2742,"cache_read_input_tokens":337681,"cache_creation_input_tokens":946,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":946},"type":"message"}],"sp