{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","hash":"cdd7b2c384f5a7122bc3deecbd5618d1dbfde04b2a2d881144315bfe50cf7118","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Pfhd1RTDJ7QnovhxSf4QvH","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"aef4b903dc16194fa","summary":"Tell agent main moved and Eduard changed saving","message":"Main moved and Eduard changed move saving, so check both before you finish the route fix.\n1. main is now 0cac793: #26 and #27 merged Sasha's BIM mode and my Plan work. They change web/main.js, web/bim.js, web/index.html, web/style.css, web/serve.py and app/api/main.py. Rebase your branch on origin/main before you commit it as finished, then rerun your reproduction and tests. The viewer now also has `window.plantViewer.plan`, and guessed links read `P-005?`.\n2. origin/eduard has a new commit, 7e60da7, \"Fix move mode, save order, stale warnings and BIM updates\". In web/route.js it queues saves so they run one at a time and in order (`syncChanges` and `saveChanges`), and it changes web/objects.js and web/main.js. Check whether that fixes the chair bug or part of it. If it does, say so in your report instead of duplicating it. If it doesn't, keep your change small and compatible with it, and report the expected conflicts.\nThe other limits stay the same: don't push, don't open a PR, don't merge."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KK6PzWTCkTdraT9fTfRz5E","name":"ListAgents","input":{},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YZT46BRTPie6dKj3srpD2a","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"W=/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/.claude/worktrees/agent-aef4b903dc16194fa; git -C \"$W\" status -sb | head -12 | cut -c1-70; echo \"--- commits on its branch\"; git -C \"$W\" log --format='%h %ar %s' 5179efa..HEAD | head -5 | cut -c1-90; echo \"--- size of its changes so far\"; git -C \"$W\" diff --stat | tail -6 | cut