{"parentUuid":"383fce6f-ceaa-4538-b0d3-ad28ea61b7e7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgod2s8VreE97HLfDaJKx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**The agent is still running, about 50 minutes in, with no report or commits yet.** It has an uncommitted fix of about 100 lines across 8 files, mostly `web/route.js`, `web/objects.js` and `web/main.js`, plus a new test in `tests/test_api.py`. Its test servers are still up, and it saved an \"after fix\" screenshot about 10 minutes ago. I can't say yet whether the fix works, and I'll report back when it finishes. Software rendering with the machine under load is part of why it's slow.\n\n**Eduard's new commit could overlap with the agent's fix.** `7e60da7` on `eduard` makes moves save one at a time and in order, which might be related to the chair bug. I've told the agent to check that, and to rebase onto the new main. It won't push anything or open a PR.\n\n**#26 and #27 are both merged.** CI passes on main (`0cac793`), and main's files are identical to what I tested. My checkout is now on `main`.\n\n**For the team:**\n- **Everyone:** run `git pull` and `make bim`, then restart the viewer to get BIM mode and Plan.\n- **Eduard:** merging main into `eduard` will conflict in `Makefile`, `app/api/main.py`, `web/bim.js` and `web/main.js`. Eduard already merged Sasha's BIM branch and changed `web/bim.js`, so that file now has edits from both of us.\n- **Benjamin:** `benjamin/webviewer` will conflict in `Makefile`, `app/api/main.py`, `web/highlight.js`, `web/index.html`, `web/main.js` and `web/style.css`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2056,"cache_read_input_tokens":349715,"output_tokens":1199,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":655},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"e