{"parentUuid":"1e415445-d5ba-4cd7-9281-75d54cce8d86","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgohWH8rBJJeBnwv5gzKm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EXDMS9ZLuxKcrPPhLsNPBz","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"W=/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/.claude/worktrees/agent-aef4b903dc16194fa; S=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-viktor-trilar-Projects-Newbies/6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028/scratchpad; cd \"$W\"; git fetch origin 2>&1 | tail -3 | cut -c1-90; for b in origin/eduard origin/benjamin/webviewer origin/hannu_branch origin/yasasha/extract; do git merge-base --is-ancestor $b HEAD && echo \"in: $b\" || echo \"NEW COMMITS: $b\"; done; echo \"main ahead by $(git rev-list --count HEAD..origin/main)\"; cat > handoffs/viktortrilar.md <<'EOF'\n# viktortrilar: viktor/merge-all\n**Goal:** get every branch's work onto main, then make the viewer faster and simpler and work on the copilot, Val, after the engineer's feedback\n**Done:** merged `eduard` (tablet mode, viewer commands, rotation, start commands, spoken answers, which includes `hannu_branch`), `benjamin/webviewer` (phone fixes, automatic light scene, tracking) and `yasasha/extract` (unused SAM3 route). BIM objects now turn around their centres. Done no longer claims Saved\n**Verified:** 229 tests passed, 20 skipped, lint clean. Headless browser on merged code: 66 of 66 route checks, Plan, move, DXF and IFC downloads, BIM mode, no page errors. Not tested: turning an object in BIM mode, 5090, tablet or touch, real tracking\n**Next:** viewer speed, a simpler UI (16 buttons show at once), rename the copilot to Val and improve it\n**Blockers:** live IFC download has boxes only (0.9 MB), while `make bim`'s file has scan meshes (13 MB). A moved object's old spot can stay blocked. `make api` restarts on any `.py` edit in the repo. Left unmerged on purpose: `sasha_branch` (empty test commit), `viktor/viewer-objects` (old merge with no work of its own)\nEOF\ngit add handoffs/viktortrilar.md; git commit -q -m \"Update handoff\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\"; git push -q git@github.com:Sairanyx/Newbies.git viktor/merge-all 2>&1 | grep -v \"^remote:\" | tail -2 | cut -c1-100; cat > \"$S/pr4.md\" <<'EOF'\nMerges every branch with unmerged work into main.\n\n**Merged:**\n- `eduard`: tablet mode, viewer commands, object rotation with collision checks, `./start`, spoken copilot answers. Includes `hannu_branch`.\n- `benjamin/webviewer`: phone UI fixes, automatic light scene on phones and tablets, device tracking.\n- `yasasha/extract`: the SAM3 and VLM extraction route and its LUMI job. Nothing in the demo calls it.\n\n**Left out on purpose:**\n- `sasha_branch`: one empty test commit.\n- `viktor/viewer-objects`: an old merge commit with no work of its own.\n\n**How conflicts were resolved:**\n- **Saving moves:** kept #29's queue and retries. Eduard's `settle` stays, and each check now remembers the spot and angle it was about. Saves are no longer rounded.\n- **BIM mode:** kept the Real, Mesh and Box looks and plain boxes for viewer-made objects, and added Eduard's turning. Scan meshes are stored in scene coordinates, so objects now turn around their own centres.\n- **Done button:** it no longer says \"Saved\", because the backend may still refuse the move. The save's own message says what happened.\n- **Handoffs:** kept the current one for Sasha.\n\n**Tested on the merged code:**\n- 229 tests passed, 20 skipped, lint clean.\n- Headless browser on the real scene: 66 of 66 route checks, Plan, moving the cart, real DXF and IFC downloads, BIM mode, no page errors.\n\n**Not tested:** turning an object in BIM mode, the 5090, a tablet or touch, real device tracking.\n\n**Known gap:** the live IFC download has boxes only (0.9 MB), while the file from `make bim` now has scan meshes (13 MB).\n\n**Teammates:** please start new work from main, because these branches are now merged. Then run `git pull`, `make bim`, and restart the viewer.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\ngh pr create --base main --head viktor/merge-all --title \"Merge Eduard's, Benjamin's and Sasha's remaining branches\" --body-file \"$S/pr4.md\" 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-90; N=$(gh pr view viktor/merge-all --json number --jq .number); sleep 8; timeout 200 gh pr checks \"$N\" --watch --interval 10 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-80; gh pr view \"$N\" --json mergeable,mergeStateStatus --jq '\"#'$N' \\(.mergeable) \\(.mergeStateStatus)\"'; gh pr merge \"$N\" --merge 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-100; gh pr view \"$N\" --json state,mergeCommit --jq '\"#'$N' \\(.state) \\(.mergeCommit.oid[0:7])\"'","description":"Confirm branches, push, open the pull request and merge it","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1846,"cache_read_input_tokens":420582,"output_tokens":2342,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":272},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1846,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2342,"cache_read_input_tokens":420582,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1846,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1846},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"toolInputStreamMs":17015,"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01EXDMS9ZLuxKcrPPhLsNPBz":{"command":"W=/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/.claude/worktrees/agent-aef4b903dc16194fa; S=/tmp/claude-1000/-home-viktor-trilar-Projects-Newbies/6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028/scratchpad; cd \"$W\"; git fetch origin 2>&1 | tail -3 | cut -c1-90; for b in origin/eduard origin/benjamin/webviewer origin/hannu_branch 