eady out of step on `eduard` and `benjamin/webviewer`, and #30 brought it to main. The browser checks on #30 didn't cover the copilot.\n\n**Tested:** in a headless browser with the Excel data, the button opens the panel, and a typed question and Ask copilot both get real answers, with no page errors.\n\n**Not tested:** the local model, the 5090, a tablet.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nEOF\ngh pr create --base main --head viktor/fix-copilot-button --title \"Make the copilot's buttons work again\" --body-file \"$S/pr5.md\" 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-80; git switch -q viktor/viewer-and-val && git rebase -q viktor/fix-copilot-button 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-80; git log --oneline -1 | cut -c1-70","description":"Commit the copilot fix and open its pull request","timeout":60000}},"serverClassifierRequest":"5214388f-b9b3-459e-86cb-bfac09c1c49c","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgohybvCptKzh99G55Atg","requestRef":"b24fcfe3-d8da-48b0-8977-a3296149c62d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"706c230f-6789-4bad-b860-3c733168b6b8","timestamp":"2026-11-07T14:14:48.991Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/viktor-trilar/Projects/Newbies/.claude/worktrees/agent-aef4b903dc16194fa","sessionId":"6293938d-e68f-4310-92b7-6bf722e3d028","version":"2.1.319","gitBranch":"viktor/fix-copilot-button","slug":"vast-jumping-lobster"}
