_document'] focus P-005\nQ[obj-0049] what should I check first?\n  A: 'Recommended check for P-005: inspect hydraulic path. Per DOC-PROCESS_PUMP-CORE, inspect multivariate parameters (vibration, bearing temp) and verify locally. In accordance with safety guardrail DOC-FIELD-SAFETY, obtain proper perm'\n  conf 0.92 cites ['DOC-PROCESS_PUMP-CORE', 'DOC-FIELD-SAFETY', 'CASE-025'] actions ['open_document'] focus P-005\nQ[obj-0049] when was it last serviced?\n  A: \"P-005 was last serviced on 2026-06-23 under work order WO-00012. Action performed: 'bearing inspection' (inspection), with result recorded as 'no_fault_found'.\"\n  conf 0.95 cites ['WO-00012', 'DOC-RAG-GUIDE'] actions ['highlight_work_order'] focus P-005\nQ[obj-0067] what is this?\n  A: \"The scan shows this as: cart. It isn't linked to a plant record, so I have no condition, measurements or service history for it, and I won't guess which device it is. I can take you to it so you can check its nameplate.\"\n  conf 0.555 cites ['DOC-3D-MAPPING'] actions ['highlight'] focus None\nQ[obj-0067] what's wrong with it?\n  A: \"The scan shows this as: cart. It isn't linked to a plant record, so I have no condition, measurements or service history for it, and I won't guess which device it is. I can take you to it so you can check its nameplate.\"\n  conf 0.555 cites ['DOC-3D-MAPPING'] actions ['highlight'] focus None\nQ[None] are there any alarms?\n  A: '4 devices are marked high urgency. Start with P-005: health 44/100, Efficiency loss / fouling-like signature. Recommended check: inspect hydraulic path. Also high urgency: P-002 (45/100), M-006 (45/100), CV-003 (52/100).'\n  conf 0.91 cites ['ASSET-017', 'ASSET-014', 'ASSET-024'] actions ['highlight'] focus None\nQ[obj-0049] which spare parts do I need?\n  A: \"I don't have records on spare parts, so I won't guess. I can see each device's condition, measurements, events, work orders and guidance documents.\"\n  conf 1.0 cites ['DOC-RAG-GUIDE'] actions [] focus None\nQ