{"parentUuid":"227c293e-009f-4679-ae45-ec62fea0b7dd","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"queued_command","prompt":[{"type":"text","text":"Some more notes and bug fixes on the UI\n- Let's have a delete button that deletes the object from the viewer, this should have a confirmation not straight up delete\n- Duplicate button that makes exactly the same object with everything in the viewer (AND BIM MODE)\n- A deselect mode/back mode when you press ESC or back button on phone\n- After combining the chair it disappears unti it is moved on the viewer\n- The combined chair also appears in the block BIM view when it shouldnt\n- There were 2 chairs visible after combine but only one had bounding boxes so one was a \"ghost\""}],"source_uuid":"f4c2e7e5-2e7c-46a3-9b68-9aefbc17cf59","delivery_id":"6d6aac5f-4f4e-4421-aa28-e867161af51b","commandMode":"prompt","origin":{"kind":"human"},"timestamp":"2026-11-07T14:49:10.761Z","humanTurn":true},"type":"attachment","uuid":"2b774116-46bd-4e49-8597-3e2c0c3e52e8","timestamp":"2026-11-07T14:49:10.761Z","rendered":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nThe user sent a new message while you were working:\nSome more notes and bug fixes on the UI\n- Let's have a delete button that deletes the object from the viewer, this should have a confirmation not straight up delete\n- Duplicate button that makes exactly the same object with everything in the viewer (AND BIM MODE)\n- A deselect mode/back mode when you press ESC or back button on phone\n- After combining the chair it disappears unti it is moved on the viewer\n- The combined chair also appears in the block BIM view when it shouldnt\n- There were 2 chairs visible after combine but only one had bounding boxes so one was a \"ghost\"\n\nThis is how Claude Code surfaces messages the user sends mid-turn — within the running turn, often alongside the next tool result, rather than as a separate conversation turn. Address the message above as you continue this turn.\n</system-rem